00:45:17,119 --> 00:45:19,522
I shouldn't have to beg
my boyfriend to touch me.

742
00:45:19,523 --> 00:45:21,226
If you were my
girlfriend, you wouldn't

743
00:45:21,227 --> 00:45:23,865
have to beg me for anything.

744
00:45:23,866 --> 00:45:25,234
Police suspect
this brutal killing

745
00:45:25,235 --> 00:45:27,539
is the work of the Trawler.

746
00:45:27,540 --> 00:45:29,577
The suspect you should
be looking at as a kid

747
00:45:29,578 --> 00:45:31,848
named Robert Mallory.

748
00:45:31,849 --> 00:45:33,551
You're a little bit obsessed
with me, aren't you, bro?

749
00:45:33,552 --> 00:45:36,557
Well, you would love
that, wouldn't you?

750
00:45:36,558 --> 00:45:40,866
And we're live in 4, 3, 2.

751
00:45:40,867 --> 00:45:41,500
Hit it.

752
00:45:44,173 --> 00:45:46,978
This feels wrong.

753
00:45:46,979 --> 00:45:49,315
No, this feels right.

754
00:45:49,316 --> 00:45:50,919
What kind of game
are you playing?

755
00:45:50,920 --> 00:45:53,558
You know what they say
about fellas who are nosy.

756
00:45:53,559 --> 00:45:54,527
They lose their noses.

757
00:45:54,528 --> 00:45:58,234
